 lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"Every morning I wake up and my first thought is you. Every night I close my eyes and my last thought is you. You are woven into every part of my day, and I would not have it any other way.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"On this anniversary, I want you to know: the best decision I ever made was letting you in. You have changed the way I see the world, the way I see myself, and the way I love.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"There is a kind of love that sneaks up on you quietly — a warmth that becomes so familiar you cannot imagine life without it. That is what you are to me.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"Funny & Playful\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10\",\"children\":\"Funny & Playful\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"Happy anniversary! Another year of tolerating my weirdness. You deserve a medal.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"On this special day, I want to thank you for ignoring all my red flags and swiping right anyway.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"I love you more than pizza, and if you knew me at all, you would know that is not a small statement.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"We are basically the cutest couple I know. I am biased, but I stand by it.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"Thanks for being the reason I smile at my phone like an idiot every day.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"section\",\"Long Distance\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10\",\"children\":\"Long Distance\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"space-y-4 mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"The miles between us do nothing to dim what I feel for you. If anything, this distance has only made me more certain that you are worth every second of the wait.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"Some days the distance feels unbearable. But then I remember that what we have is rare — a love strong enough to survive the miles — and I feel proud of us.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"bg-muted/30 rounded-xl p-4 border border-border/40 flex items-start gap-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-heart h-4 w-4 text-rose-400 fill-rose-200 shrink-0 mt-1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"c3ymky\",{\"d\":\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm leading-relaxed\",\"children\":[\"\\\"\",\"I carry you with me everywhere I go. You are in every beautiful song, every sunset, every quiet moment. Distance cannot change that.\",\"\\\"\"]}]]}]]}]]}]],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"className\":\"text-2xl font-bold mt-10\",\"children\":\"Take It Further: Create an Anniversary Wishes Website\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":[\"Words in a text message are beautiful. But imagine delivering your anniversary message as a fully personalised, animated, music-backed\",\" \",[\"$\",\"$L5\",null,{\"href\":\"/digital-greeting\",\"className\":\"text-primary hover:underline\",\"children\":\"Wishes Website\"}],\" — a digital experience your partner can open, re-read, and share with the world. It takes less than two minutes to create, and it is completely free.\"]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4 my-6\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",\"Beautiful animations\",{\"className\":\"p-4 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/20 rounded-xl border border-rose-100 dark:border-rose-900/30 text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":24,\"height\":24,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-star h-6 w-6 text-rose-500 mx-auto mb-2\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"r04s7s\",{\"d\":\"M11.525 2.295a.53.53 0 0 1 .95 0l2.31 4.679a2.123 2.123 0 0 0 1.595 1.16l5.166.756a.53.53 0 0 1 .294.904l-3.736 3.638a2.123 2.123 0 0 0-.611 1.878l.882 5.14a.53.53 0 0 1-.771.56l-4.618-2.428a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-1.973 0L6.396 21.01a.53.53 0 0 1-.77-.56l.881-5.139a2.122 2.122 0 0 0-.611-1.879L2.16 9.795a.53.53 0 0 1 .294-.906l5.165-.755a2.122 2.122 0 0 0 1.597-1.16z\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"text-sm font-medium\",\"children\":\"Beautiful animations\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",\"Personalised message\",{\"className\":\"p-4 bg-rose-50 dark:bg-rose-950/20 rounded-xl border border-rose-100 dark:border-rose-900/30 tex